      "value": "Your idea is also same for 'marriage' part. But there is problem, how can you hold hands between little loli and big giant avatars. This might stretch the arm of loli or so... or something strange happens.\n\nSame if your friend walk away while holding hands, you are forced to move with him and you have no control over it. This will look also akward. \nThe idea is good, but i am afraid the practical use is a problem between different avatars with another heights or no arms, or different walking directions. Not sure if pulling is possible or not.\n\nLucky VR headsets will allow move your hands freely so you can virtually hold other hands. It's not really big problem.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
